id=workprofile_loopback_fix
name=Android 17 Cross-Profile Loopback Fix
version=v1.3
versionCode=4
author=deepseek
description=Disables Android 17's cross-profile loopback block (netd eBPF map) once at boot via service.sh. Works on Magisk and KernelSU (including late-load). Reboot restores the default.
